{
  "name": "Transcribe recordings into Google Docs with FonadaLabs",
  "summary": "Turn a recording URL into a Google Doc transcript.",
  "description": "Receive a direct audio URL, transcribe using the customer's FonadaLabs connection, and create a Google document. Configure connections before publishing.\n\nSetup: connect your FonadaLabs API key (audio is processed in the FonadaLabs cloud). For recordings longer than about 8 minutes, set the host variable AP_FLOW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3600 and set the FonadaLabs step's 'Action time budget' to 3300. The webhook receives JSON with audio_url (reachable from the worker) and language.",
  "author": "hiyaa-atFonada",
  "categories": [
    "Productivity"
  ],
  "type": "CUSTOM",
  "tags": [
    {
      "title": "Speech to text",
      "color": "#8142E3"
    }
  ],
  "flows": [
    {
      "displayName": "Recording to Google Docs",
      "schemaVersion": "28",
      "valid": false,
      "trigger": {
        "name": "trigger",
        "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z",
        "displayName": "Receive recording",
        "type": "PIECE_TRIGGER",
        "valid": true,
        "settings": {
          "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-webhook",
          "pieceVersion": "0.1.43",
          "input": {
            "authType": "none",
            "authFields": {}
          },
          "propertySettings": {},
          "triggerName": "catch_webhook"
        },
        "nextAction": {
          "name": "step_1",
          "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z",
          "displayName": "Transcribe recording",
          "type": "PIECE",
          "valid": false,
          "settings": {
            "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-fonadalabs",
            "pieceVersion": "0.2.0",
            "input": {
              "audioUrl": "{{trigger['output'].body.audio_url}}",
              "language": "{{trigger['output'].body.language}}"
            },
            "propertySettings": {},
            "actionName": "transcribe_audio",
            "errorHandlingOptions": {
              "retryOnFailure": {
                "value": false
              },
              "continueOnFailure": {
                "value": false
              }
            }
          },
          "nextAction": {
            "name": "step_2",
            "lastUpdatedDate": "2026-11-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "displayName": "Create transcript document",
            "type": "PIECE",
            "valid": false,
            "settings": {
              "pieceName": "@activepieces/piece-google-docs",
              "pieceVersion": "0.7.1",
              "input": {
                "title": "{{trigger['output'].body.title}}",
                "body": "{{step_1['output'].text}}"
              },
              "propertySettings": {},
              "actionName": "create_document",
              "errorHandlingOptions": {
                "retryOnFailure": {
                  "value": false
                },
                "continueOnFailure": {
                  "value": false
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": "fonadalabs-setup-audio-to-google-docs",
          "content": "### Setup\n1. **Transcribe recording:** select your FonadaLabs connection.\n2. **Create transcript document:** select your Google Docs connection.\n3. Publish, then send JSON to the webhook URL:\n```json\n{\"audio_url\": \"https://.../call.mp3\", \"language\": \"en\", \"title\": \"Call transcript\"}\n```\n`audio_url` must be reachable from the Activepieces worker.\n\n**Long recordings (over ~8 min):** set the host variable `AP_FLOW_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3600` and the FonadaLabs step's **Action time budget** to `3300`.\n\nAudio is processed in the FonadaLabs cloud. Recordings above 24 MB must be MP3 or WAV.",
          "ownerId": null,
          "color": "yellow",
          "position": {
            "x": -520,
            "y": 0
          },
          "size": {
            "width": 440,
            "height": 520
          },
          "createdAt": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
